### Base URL
#@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/device-service    cand nu aveam reverse proxy

### Base URL prin Traefik Reverse Proxy (Port 80)
@baseUrl = http://localhost/device-service
@sampleUserId = 6d7f4949-8352-4a2b-9b09-cc9b594b7ca9

### 1. Inserare Dispozitiv Nou (POST /device)
POST {{baseUrl}}/device
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Smart Meter - Panou Solar",
  "address": "Strada Memorandumului 28, Cluj-Napoca",
  "maxHourlyEnergyConsumption": 18.5
}

> {%
    client.global.set("generatedDeviceId", response.body);
%}

### 2. Preluare Toate Dispozitivele (GET /device)
GET {{baseUrl}}/device
Accept: application/json

### 3. Preluare Dispozitiv dupa ID (GET /device/{id})
# Foloseste automat ID-ul generat la Pasul 1 daca rulati in IntelliJ, sau inlocuiti cu un UUID existent
GET {{baseUrl}}/device/{{generatedDeviceId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Actualizare Dispozitiv si Mapare catre un Client (PUT /device/{id})
# Actualizeaza campurile si asociaza dispozitivul la un userId (Client)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/device/{{generatedDeviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Smart Meter - Panou Solar Modernizat",
  "address": "Strada Memorandumului 28, Cluj-Napoca, deviceEt. 2",
  "maxHourlyEnergyConsumption": 25.0,
  "userId": "{{sampleUserId}}"
}

### 5. Preluare Dispozitive Alocate unui Client (GET /device/user/{userId})
GET {{baseUrl}}/device/user/{{sampleUserId}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Stergere Dispozitiv dupa ID (DELETE /device/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/device/{{generatedDeviceId}}

### 7. Stergere Dispozitive dupa User ID (DELETE /device/user/{userId})
# Folosit pentru sincronizarea stergerii utilizatorilor din user-service
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/device/user/{{sampleUserId}}
